## 📋 Game State Schema Reference

### Valid Entity Types

Use these values for `entity_type` when creating entities in `state_updates`.

### EntityType
Type of game entity

Allowed values: pc, npc, creature, loc, item, faction, obj

### Campaign Tier Progression

Use these values for `custom_campaign_state.campaign_tier` to track character progression.

### CampaignTier
Campaign power tier. Mortal (levels 1-10), Divine (11-17, deity interactions), Sovereign (18-20, multiverse-scale)

Allowed values: mortal, divine, sovereign

