### 📦 Equipment Slots (CANONICAL)

**Valid slots:** `head`, `armor`, `cloak`, `hands`, `feet`, `neck`, `ring_1`, `ring_2`, `belt`, `shield`, `main_hand`, `off_hand`, `instrument`, `weapons` (array), `backpack` (array)

**Item format:** `{"name": "Item Name", "stats": "bonuses", "equipped": true}`

**Spell DC / Spell Attack equipment:** When granting an item that provides a Spell Save DC or Spell Attack Bonus, ALWAYS place it in `equipment.equipped.{slot}` with the bonus in the `stats` field. Use exact wording the backend recognizes:
- `"stats": "+3 to Spell Save DC"` — adds to Spell Save DC
- `"stats": "+2 to Spell Attack Bonus"` — adds to Spell Attack Bonus
- ❌ **WRONG:** Putting spell DC items only in `inventory` as bare strings — the backend cannot read bonuses from inventory and the player's spell DC will not update.

**Example (correct):**
```json
"equipment": {
  "equipped": {
    "ring_1": {"name": "Ring of Spell Power", "stats": "+3 to Spell Save DC", "equipped": true}
  }
}
```

**❌ FORBIDDEN:** `weapon_main`→`main_hand`, `weapon_secondary`→`off_hand`, `gloves`→`hands`, `boots`→`feet`, `amulet`→`neck`

